{"kind":"field","id":"R0058","key":"architecture","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"Decentralized multi-UAV-to-multi-edge-server architecture: N autonomous UAVs (buyers) bid to offload AI inference tasks to M ground base-station edge servers (sellers) within coverage C_m, with peer bidder cross-verification of server clearing prices and local buffering/fallback when unallocated.","locators":[{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0058.pdf","page":5,"section":"3.1. Inference offloading model","quote":"The system consists of a set of autonomous UAVs N = {1,2,...,N} and edge servers M = {1,2,...,M} deployed at ground base stations."},{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0058.pdf","page":13,"section":"4.4. Payment verification mechanism","quote":"introduces a Payment Verification Mechanism, whose core idea is to ensure the authenticity and consistency of server payment behaviors through bidder-side information collaboration"}],"gap":null}
