{"kind":"field","id":"R0058","key":"partition_assignment","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"Binary full-task offloading per time slot (a_{nm}(t) in {0,1}, sum_m a_{nm}(t) <= 1): each UAV offloads its entire inference task to at most one winning edge server (selecting the highest net-utility offer if multiple accept), or buffers/executes locally in simplified form if unallocated.","locators":[{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0058.pdf","page":5,"section":"3.1. Inference offloading model","quote":"each task can be offloaded to at most one edge server."},{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0058.pdf","page":7,"section":"3.2. Inference delay and energy consumption model","quote":"As the task is entirely offloaded, only the energy expenditure associated with communication is considered."}],"gap":null}
{"kind":"field","id":"R0058","key":"optimization","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"Decision variables: binary offloading a_{nm}(t) and server resource allocation f_m(t). Objective: minimize long-term weighted latency minus accuracy (and maximize aggregate buyer+seller auction utility). Constraints: d_{nm}^{total} <= d_{nm}^{con}, 0 <= f_m(t) <= F_m^{max}, binary single-server assignment, and UAV energy budget E_n^{max}. Solver: polynomial-time O(MN log N) one-round distributed auction (DADAO) with (k+1)-th highest bid uniform clearing price, truthfulness/budget-balance guarantees, and bidder payment verification.","locators":[{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0058.pdf","page":8,"section":"3.4. Problem formulation","quote":"P: min_{{a_{nm}(t), f_m(t)}} lim_{T->infinity} (1/T) sum_{t=1}^T sum_{n=1}^N sum_{m=1}^M a_{nm}(t) . [alpha . d_{nm}^{total}(t) - gamma . Lambda_{nm}(t)]"},{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0058.pdf","page":15,"section":"5. Theoretical Analysis","quote":"the overall time complexity of the offloading mechanism is O(MN log N + NM) = O(MN log N)"}],"gap":null}
