{"kind":"field","id":"R0064","key":"outcomes","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"Reports average inference delay (s), average accuracy, accumulated reward, PoI monitoring counts, and Jain's sensing fairness (~0.74). At 2 MHz bandwidth, MAPPO-HA reduces inference delay by 9.28% (MAPPO-DA), 16.8% (MADQN), 19.54% (SFSC), 20.45% (FFT), 25.62% (OEC), and 39.05% (OLC); overall average delay reduction is 7%-43%.","locators":[{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0064.pdf","page":9,"section":"5.2.2. Impact of communication bandwidth","quote":"when the bandwidth is only 2 MHz, the inference delay of the MAPPO-HA algorithm is reduced by 9.28%, 16.8%, 19.54%, 20.45%, 25.62% and 39.05%, respectively."}],"gap":null}
