{"kind":"field","id":"R0075","key":"architecture","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"Star/Master-Assistant multi-UAV collaborative early-exit architecture: m Assistant UAVs (default 3; 2-5 student models tested) execute local multi-exit student models in parallel and transmit selected intermediate exit features to 1 Master UAV, which projects, concatenates, and fuses features with its own representation to produce the final prediction.","locators":[{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0075.pdf","page":4,"section":"III.A Task Definition","quote":"The Assistant UAVs process local student branches and selectively transmit intermediate features to the Master UAV, while the Master UAV aggregates the received features with its own representation to produce the final prediction y_hat."}],"gap":null}
