{"kind":"field","id":"R0075","key":"outcomes","status":"OBSERVED","finding":"Reports accuracy (%), routing-controlled Comp.+Comm. latency (ms), average FLOPs (M), and calibration (ECE 0.0245-0.0738, Brier 0.0895-0.2477, NLL 0.3247-0.6886). On CIFAR-10, CIDER attains 89.09% accuracy and 26.85 ms latency vs 91.30%/38.81 ms (Full Final Exit) and 87.58%/22.03 ms (COBEE); on CIFAR-100, 71.04% and 25.56 ms vs 72.05%/28.40 ms (COBEE) and 74.02%/36.71 ms (Full Final Exit).","locators":[{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0075.pdf","page":10,"section":"IV.B Results Analysis","quote":"On CIFAR-10, CIDER attains 89.09% accuracy with 17.91 ms computation, 8.94 ms communication, and 26.85 ms combined latency."},{"source":"restart_2026_11_26/fulltext_retrieval/pdf/R0075.pdf","page":10,"section":"IV.B Results Analysis","quote":"On CIFAR-100, CIDER obtains 71.04% accuracy with 16.83 ms computation, 8.73 ms communication, and 25.56 ms combined latency."}],"gap":null}
